# The exact denial each document in admission-install-network-bypasses.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
NetworkPolicy kyverno/default-deny must isolate every Pod for ingress and egress
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-admission-webhook widens its exact reviewed admission flow
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-debug-shell is outside the exact admission webhook, DNS, API-server, and signature-verification allowlist
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-kube-apiserver widens its exact reviewed admission flow
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-kube-apiserver widens its exact reviewed admission flow
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-kube-apiserver widens its exact reviewed admission flow
NetworkPolicy kyverno/kyverno-public-https widens its exact reviewed admission flow
